  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan and Lu Wei Yin reach the eighth-layer void, three great-world bubbles sit joint at the center, green, yellow, and red, with smaller worlds linked around them. The green one is Green Lotus Great World. Narration calls it the Dao field of Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable: forests and vegetation are abundant, filled with greenery and vitality.",
      "chapters": [
        2155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court controls Green Lotus Great World while Longevity Heaven controls Savage Wilderness Great World. The three great worlds were made one after another: Savage Wilderness Great World has the longest history, Green Lotus Great World is second, and Yellow Earth Great World is the most recent because Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable was the most recent venerable. Green Lotus has more Gu Immortals than Yellow Earth. A huge tunnel connects Yellow Earth Great World and Green Lotus Great World, and Green Lotus armies pass through it under Qing Hao Zi and Mu Cha Lang.",
      "chapters": [
        2156
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "among-the-three-worlds",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "loc_savage_wilderness_great_world",
        "loc_yellow_earth_great_world",
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_qing_hao_zi",
        "char_mu_cha_lang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Green Lotus Great World fields many Immortal Gu Houses of terrifying strength. Fang Yuan’s two groups gather and invade it, which observers also describe as an attack on Green Lotus Dao field.",
      "chapters": [
        2158
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "invasion-target",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Extremity Gai Mei states that Green Lotus Great World was created by Heavenly Court’s Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable, just as Yellow Earth Great World was Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable’s arrangement. Fang Yuan’s subordinates break defense lines and push to the world’s center.",
      "chapters": [
        2159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "genesis-lotus-arrangement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heaven_extremity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Gu Immortals die during the retreat from its center, their immortal apertures land and are absorbed by Green Lotus Great World, and their Immortal Gu dissolve quickly. Obsession remains, but Fang Yuan sees no land spirit or heavenly spirit born.",
      "chapters": [
        2160
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "absorbs-fallen-apertures",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Green Lotus Great World’s sage gives a Dao lesson, many Gu Immortals improve their impression of the world and choose to join it. Some from Savage Wilderness Great World defect there, even more than to Yellow Earth Great World. Longevity Heaven and Fang Yuan later send troops to attack it again.",
      "chapters": [
        2164
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dao-lessons-and-defections",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the worlds merge further, Green Lotus Great World expands continuously and absorbs the other two great worlds into its territory. From above, green like moss spreads from it and slowly covers the other two.",
      "chapters": [
        2194
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "expanding-green",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration of the Crazed Demon Cave contest names Green Lotus Great World’s Heavenly Court as one of the three parties, alongside Savage Wilderness Great World’s Longevity Heaven and Yellow Earth Great World’s Paradise Earth.",
      "chapters": [
        2212
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-seat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave"
      ]
    }
  ],
